      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "2 wrong guess, broken",
      "narration_text": "But open the manifest and there's no permissions block, no sandbox field — nothing to check. A packaged MCPB runs with exactly the same file access as the original, unpackaged script. Package a path bug into it, and it walks outside its own folder exactly as easily.",
