    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "3 mechanism",
      "narration_text": "The env var name is exactly what you wrote in the manifest — no auto-prefix, no transform. Write ROOT_DIR in the manifest but read ROOT_DIRECTORY in your server code, and the value comes back silently empty. No error, no crash — the config is just quietly ignored.",
