    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "5 both directions",
      "narration_text": "A packaged MCPB that runs fine on your machine doesn't prove it's safe anywhere else — it may only prove your own dev toolchain quietly filled a gap. And an MCPB that fails on a clean machine doesn't mean the packaging step is broken — it usually means one dependency never actually got bundled in.",
